Pin components/cmeps to fvitt/CMEPS waccmx-mage @ a7c0b51a98ee57a0b33dc75a43cbc1320385032d.

The fxtag cmeps1.1.54 that fvitt/CAM waccmx_mage_cplng @ da3bc8d52 records resolves to ESCOMP
cmeps1.1.54, whose cesm/driver/esmApp.F90 has no MPI_COMM_split: the MPMD coupled job then hangs
at ESMF init.  Apply this in the CAM clone before ./bin/git-fleximod update; a
bare `git checkout` inside components/cmeps is silently reverted by the next fleximod update.

    git apply $KAIJUHOME/scripts/waxrun/config/cmeps_pin.patch
    ./bin/git-fleximod update

